# Triplicate Titan's trigger is "when this creature dies" (CR 700.4): exiled by Swords to Plowshares it goes from the
# battlefield to exile, not to a graveyard, so no Golem is made. Bot1 gains 9 life for its power.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Dark Ritual
Entomb
Reanimate
Black Lotus
Swords to Plowshares
Swamp
Triplicate Titan
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Triplicate Titan)
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Triplicate Titan)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Triplicate Titan)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp
Exile = Triplicate Titan
